<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obtūro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1 (old <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>inf. pass.</i> obturarier,
				<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 154</span></i>), v.
			a., <i>to stop up</i>, <i>to
			close</i> (class.; syn.: oblino, obstruo). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gutturem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul. 2, 4, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Stich. 1, 2, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foramina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 10, 58, § 178</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolia operculis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					7, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to refuse to listen</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 2, 2, 105</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obstructas eas partes et obturatas esse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fat. 5, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oculos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Num. 24, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ora leonum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Heb. 11, 33</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to assuage</i>, <i>allay</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amorem edendi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					4, 869</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
